# Cursor Rule — Components

Follow `.ai/05-components.md`.

- Search for an existing component before creating a new one (grep/glob the codebase).
- Extend, do not fork.
- Each reusable component documents: purpose, usage, variants, props, states, responsive behavior, accessibility, examples.
- Props must be typed.
- Side effects belong in hooks/services, not presentational components.
- Update `docs/COMPONENTS.md` when adding or significantly changing a component.
